ogle.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxNSWpGMXlVUXdsNmpISnFzNUFDbWsyQkwzWkhxd0J2UHFVVXZPRE5CZ28taHQxb2dCNVYwaGNyLTRoYzdlSXAxT3A3SjBfQjVlUTY4bUxFdWpJVGV6SHVnY2plV003QW43QUJneTJ2WXBONlNrZS1oN3BHckdFNDRySFZRTElOaXl1MVRqUTVZbmY1cmo1SF8xMk9NWGE2LUdPbk5fazRSMFR2TVpYMVlCYWJQN3RGWmhjREpBOTdLeDFnNkhQNDgzcE5R?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"Nisa Investment Advisors LLC 收購景順 QQQ 的 14,693 股股票 $QQQ"},{"title":"IonQ Is Now Down 24% in a Month: Is IONQ a Toxic Stock or Ready for a Recovery?","src":"24/7 Wall St.","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxOZkNpWS1GZ3Z1X3JNenVWZENJTHVwanYwa01XZ0cwLXRQX0gySnZwVDFqZndaalhVSkM0TG9CNUJlZXVESTZXVzhWVU9ERUVGUzZGUjRadzV6Z3I5MnRtYW9vdUMxREVHWTNObjFpYXF2RTZ3OHNxNmdJY2hwMFBkd0Vua1lzZjN0LWlfMUZJbTVFU1lZaXBSVks0NE1WQWd6Vm1FNVI0NzN1SlNoOG1pM0hGX05NMjBBS056eQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"IonQ 現在一個月內下跌 24%：IONQ 是一支有毒股票還是已經準備好復甦？"},{"title":"What Invesco QQQ (QQQ) Bought: NVIDIA Leads on Oct. 19","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQVDBJRUxrTEY4Q2FjSHZsV3pkTlVENFltTGZnMnRGWV83RTFubHllN3dIc0tTMVI3V1E2RFdvTGwwcjFnb0k3RFlBMlNibUtSOUpMZWZtM1FmLWhxdEZNZXpVaXozQU0zQjlTcDNFcUFqZ3pfU01vTnlnYUJ1TE5LWENfaG51QVFjcmRxRjN4T1dPSXFwSkxER1B3?oc=5","date":"2026-10-21","zh":"Invesco QQQ (QQQ) 購買了什麼：10 月 19 日 NVIDIA 領先"}],"themes":[{"name":"訂單/合約","count":2},{"name":"併購","count":2},{"name":"能源/電力","count":1},{"name":"財報","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-24","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/914208/000091420826000079/ivz-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Invesco Ltd. (the Parent), along with its consolidated entities (collectively, Invesco or the company), is an independent investment management firm dedicated to delivering a superior investment experience. Our comprehensive range of active, passive and alternative investment capabilities has been constructed over many years to help clients achieve their investment objectives. We draw on this comprehensive range of capabilities to provide solutions designed to deliver key outcomes aligned to client needs.","zh":"Invesco Ltd.（母公司）及其合併實體（統稱為景順或公司）是一家獨立的投資管理公司，致力於提供卓越的投資體驗。我們多年來累積了全面的主動、被動和另類投資能力，幫助客戶實現其投資目標。我們利用這種全面的能力來提供旨在交付符合客戶需求的關鍵成果的解決方案。"},{"en":"With approximately 7,500 employees and an on-the-ground presence in more than 20 countries, Invesco is well positioned to meet the needs of investors across the globe. We have specialized investment teams managing investments across a broad range of asset classes, investment styles and geographies. For decades, individuals and institutions have viewed Invesco as a trusted partner for a comprehensive set of investment needs. We have a significant presence in the retail and institutional markets within the investment management industry in the Americas, Europe, Middle East and Africa (EMEA) and Asia-Pacific (APAC), serving clients in more than 120 countries. As of December 31, 2025, the firm managed approximately $2.2 trillion in assets for investors around the world.","zh":"Invesco 擁有約 7,500 名員工，並在 20 多個國家/地區開展業務，能夠很好地滿足全球投資者的需求。我們擁有專業的投資團隊，管理廣泛的資產類別、投資風格和地理的投資。幾十年來，個人和機構一直將景順視為可滿足全面投資需求的值得信賴的合作夥伴。我們在美洲、歐洲、中東和非洲 (EMEA) 以及亞太地區 (APAC) 投資管理產業的零售和機構市場中佔有重要地位，為 120 多個國家的客戶提供服務。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，該公司為全球投資者管理約 2.2 兆美元的資產。"},{"en":"The key drivers of success for Invesco are strong long-term investment performance, positive market performance, high-quality client service, effective distribution relationships delivered across a diverse spectrum of investment management capabilities, distribution channels, geographic areas and market exposures, and competitive pricing. Through our focus on these areas, we seek to deliver better outcomes for clients, generate competitive investment results and positive net flows, and increase AUM and revenues.","zh":"景順成功的關鍵驅動力是強勁的長期投資績效、積極的市場表現、高品質的客戶服務、在各種投資管理能力、分銷管道、地理區域和市場風險方面建立的有效分銷關係，以及具有競爭力的定價。透過對這些領域的關注，我們尋求為客戶提供更好的成果，產生有競爭力的投資結果和正的淨流量，並增加資產管理規模和收入。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The investment management business is highly competitive, with points of differentiation including investment performance, fees, range of products offered, brand recognition, business reputation, financial strength, depth and continuity of relationships and quality of service. We compete with a large number of investment management firms, commercial banks, investment banks, broker-dealers, hedge funds, insurance companies and, increasingly, firms outside the traditional financial services industry, such as technology providers. Many of these competitors have greater financial resources and higher brand recognition than Invesco. However, we believe our experience as a trusted partner to clients, the quality and diversity of our investment capabilities, product types and channels of distribution, and our commitment to innovation enable us to compete effectively in the global investment man","zh":"投資管理業務競爭激烈，差異化點包括投資績效、費用、提供的產品範圍、品牌知名度、商業聲譽、財務實力、關係的深度和連續性以及服務品質。我們與大量投資管理公司、商業銀行、投資銀行、經紀自營商、對沖基金、保險公司以及越來越多的傳統金融服務業以外的公司（例如技術提供者）競爭。其中許多競爭對手比景順擁有更多的財力和更高的品牌知名度。然而，我們相信，我們作為客戶值得信賴的合作夥伴的經驗、我們投資能力的品質和多樣性、產品類型和分銷管道以及我們對創新的承諾使我們能夠在全球投資人中有效競爭"},{"en":"We derive substantially all of our revenues from investment management contracts. Fees vary with the type of assets being managed, with higher fees earned on actively managed equity and balanced accounts, along with real estate and other alternative asset products, and with lower fees earned on fixed income, money market, stable value accounts, and ETFs. Investment management contracts are generally terminable upon thirty or fewer days' notice. Typically, retail investors may withdraw their funds at any time without prior notice and institutional clients may elect to terminate their relationship with investment managers or reduce the aggregate amount of AUM with very short notice periods.","zh":"我們幾乎所有收入都來自投資管理合約。費用因所管理的資產類型而異，主動管理的股票和平衡帳戶以及房地產和其他另類資產產品的費用較高，而固定收益、貨幣市場、穩定價值帳戶和 ETF 的費用較低。投資管理合約通常可在提前三十天或更少天發出通知後終止。通常，散戶投資者可以隨時撤回資金，恕不另行通知，機構客戶可以選擇終止與投資經理人的關係或在很短的通知期內減少資產管理規模總額。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Investment Advice","val":4615300000,"zh":"投資建議"},{"name":"Distribution & Shareholder Service","val":1518100000,"zh":"分銷及股東服務"},{"name":"Financial Service Other","val":202200000,"zh":"金融服務其他"},{"name":"Investment Performance","val":41500000,"zh":"投資表現"}],"total":6377100000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Americas","val":4766100000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"EMEA","val":1315700000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":295300000,"zh":"亞太"}],"total":6377100000}},"peers":["BEN","HST","NTRS","LNC","PFG"]}}